- op: discuss  # 005e
  at: '2026-07-11T00:50:08Z'  # 005e
  by: agent  # 005e
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 005e
  clock: 4  # 005e
  nonce: 005e  # 005e
  message: "Fixed (bundled PR, merged as abd9b2dd65). Root cause: Limits.to_dict emitted partial_results_reason unconditionally (as '' on a complete analysis), violating the spec §994 'present only when analysis_incomplete: true' conditional-presence contract, so a consumer keying on presence got a false positive. Fix: emit the key only when a reason is set (non-empty). Behavioral evidence: Limits().to_dict() no longer contains 'partial_results_reason'; Limits(partial_results_reason='...').to_dict() still contains it verbatim; the crashed-pass path (test_run_behavior_map) sets a non-empty reason so it stays present. Schema: partial_results_reason moved into the ClassSpec conditional set (no longer required); regenerated docs/schema.json. Tests: test_partial_results_reason_omitted_when_empty + _present_when_set. 100% coverage. (Cross-link: WI-zafid owns the broader analysis_incomplete<->reason consistency channel; this closes the specific §994 presence violation.)"  # 005e
